                                    </svg>
                                </a>
                                <a class="project__action secondary" href="https://github.com/DanTheDev22/Tradebot">
                                    GitHub
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 4.42 2.865 8.166 6.839 9.489.5.092.682-.217.682-.482 0-.237-.008-.866-.013-1.7-2.782.603-3.369-1.342-3.369-1.342-.454-1.155-1.11-1.463-1.11-1.463-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.03 1.531 1.03.892 1.529 2.341 1.087 2.91.831.092-.646.35-1.086.636-1.336-2.22-.253-4.555-1.11-4.555-4.943 0-1.091.39-1.984 1.029-2.683-.103-.253-.446-1.27.098-2.647 0 0 .84-.269 2.75 1.025A9.578 9.578 0 0112 6.836a9.59 9.59 0 012.504.337c1.909-1.294 2.747-1.025 2.747-1.025.546 1.377.202 2.394.1 2.647.64.699 1.028 1.592 1.028 2.683 0 3.842-2.339 4.687-4.566 4.935.359.309.678.919.678 1.852 0 1.336-.012 2.415-.012 2.743 0 .267.18.578.688.48C19.138 20.163 22 16.418 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <dl class="project__details">
                            <div class="project__detail">
                                <dt class="project__detail-label">Problem</dt>
                                <dd class="project__detail-value">Users needed a quicker way to check market data and perform common actions in one place.</dd>
                            </div>
                            <div class="project__detail">
                                <dt class="project__detail-label">Goal</dt>
                                <dd class="project__detail-value">Simplify repeated actions and make key information easier to access through chat.</dd>
                            </div>
                            <div class="project__detail">
                                <dt class="project__detail-label">Users</dt>
                                <dd class="project__detail-value">Retail traders and mobile-first users who need quick, command-based access.</dd>
                            </div>
                            <div class="project__detail project__detail--extended">
                                <dt class="project__detail-label">Key UX decisions</dt>
                                <dd class="project__detail-value">
                                    <ul class="project__detail-list">
                                        <li class="project__detail-list-item">Used a chat-based interaction model to reduce learning curve</li>
                                        <li class="project__detail-list-item">Prioritized short command flows over multi-step navigation</li>
                                        <li class="project__detail-list-item">Structured outputs for quick scanning under time pressure</li>
                                        <li class="project__detail-list-item">Reduced cognitive load by keeping responses concise and action-oriented</li>
                                        <li class="project__detail-list-item">Focused on speed and clarity instead of decorative UI</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </dd>
                            </div>
                            <div class="project__detail">
                                <dt class="project__detail-label">Outcome</dt>
                                <dd class="project__detail-value">Created a lightweight interface that made key actions faster and easier to access.</dd>
                            </div>
                        </dl>

                        <ul class="project__tech">
                            <li class="project__tech-item">SPRING BOOT</li>
                            <li class="project__tech-item">TELEGRAM BOT API</li>
                            <li class="project__tech-item">POSTGRESQL</li>
                            <li class="project__tech-item">REDIS</li>
                            <li class="project__tech-item">DOCKER</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    import Slider from './Projects.js';

    new Slider();
</script>